abstract: "An open-source Python framework unifying 22 UQ estimators for uncertainty quantification in financial LLM deployments, with six-regime regulatory compliance reporting (NIST AI 600-1 GenAI Profile of AI RMF 1.0, EU AI Act 2024/1689, BCBS 239, BCB Resolução 4.893/2021, ISO/IEC 23894:2023, and ISO/IEC 42001:2023) and governance layers. SR 11-7 three-pillar mapping cross-referenced separately."
